448
00:23:26.834 --> 00:23:27.994
los datos.

449
00:23:32.106 --> 00:23:34.267
A medio metro a la derecha, Geordi.

450
00:23:39.146 --> 00:23:41.114
Aren &#x27;t tú no vas a guiarlo

